          "confidence": 0.9,
          "synopsis": "Describes the Bayesian version of the independent samples t-test using the harpo.csv data set. Selecting the 'Bayes factor' checkbox in jamovi with the default 'Prior' yields a Bayes factor of 1.75, about 1.8:1 evidence for the alternative. Contrasts this with the orthodox t-test, which gave p = .043, noting Bayesian methods usually require more evidence before rejecting the null.",
          "pages": [
            447,
            448
          ],
          "figure_ids": [
            "fig_45ecdb7da7734b_3605_v2",
            "fig_45ecdb7da7734b_3606_v2",
